From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:44:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: m4: power the J604 display down while
 blanked by default

The display power-down while blanked (Aurora #1059 plus the J604
enablement) ran only with appledrm.power_gate_ms set (default 0, as in
#1059 for J713). Ship it on for the J604, as the port rule asks; the
parameter, writable at run time, stays the way back (0: never, from the
next blank).

The machine profile carries the default: J604 5000 ms, J713 and J715 0.
A value given on the command line wins over the profile. 5 s keeps a
short blank (a screensaver flicker, a DPMS round trip) from paying the
power-up; the macOS delay is not known (INFERENCE). Only a DCP that can
gate (gate_capable) does anything with it.

Built and run 21/21 in 1.610 (2026-11-08). Still
TO-VERIFY on the J604: the retention words 0x2504c/0x25070 (a J713
capture). The 1.612 plan runs the gate A/B (enter/exit, picture time,
saving, no flicker or underrun in the log) before this stays on.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-profile.h | 11 +++++++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c       | 12 ++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 21 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-profile.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-profile.h
index fd9bec2028..29eca0da53 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-profile.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp-m4-profile.h
@@ -40,6 +40,12 @@ struct dcp_m4_profile {
 	 * (appledrm.panel_edr given at boot overrides it).
 	 */
 	bool edr;
+	/*
+	 * Power the DCP and its display domains down after this many ms blanked
+	 * by default, 0 for never (appledrm.power_gate_ms given at boot
+	 * overrides it). Only where the DCP can (gate_capable).
+	 */
+	u32 power_gate_ms;
 	/*
 	 * The qualified preferred timing (ID 2), horizontal then vertical:
 	 * Active, Total, FrontPorch, SyncWidth, BackPorch, PreciseSyncRate,
@@ -132,6 +138,11 @@ static const struct dcp_m4_profile dcp_m4_profile_j604 = {
 	.vrr_min_hz = 48,
 	/* Liquid Retina XDR: 1600 nits peak (ADT LmaxProduct), SDR 600. */
 	.edr = true,
+	/*
+	 * A blank longer than 5 s is not a flicker of the screensaver or a
+	 * DPMS round trip; the macOS delay is not known (INFERENCE).
+	 */
+	.power_gate_ms = 5000,
 	.timing = dcp_m4_timing_j604, .timing_elements = 6,
 	.alloc_page_align = true,
 };
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c
index 73ad1f0b51..4387e46888 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_m4.c
@@ -93,10 +93,16 @@ MODULE_PARM_DESC(idle_cache_ms,
 		 "J713: cache a static frame after this many ms without a flip (0: never, at most 60000; applies from the next swap)");
 
 static unsigned int power_gate_ms;
+/* Given on the command line or written: the machine default stays out. */
+static bool power_gate_ms_given;
 
 static int power_gate_ms_set(const char *val, const struct kernel_param *kp)
 {
-	return param_set_uint_minmax(val, kp, 0, 600000);
+	int ret = param_set_uint_minmax(val, kp, 0, 600000);
+
+	if (!ret)
+		WRITE_ONCE(power_gate_ms_given, true);
+	return ret;
 }
 
 static const struct kernel_param_ops power_gate_ms_ops = {
@@ -106,7 +112,7 @@ static const struct kernel_param_ops power_gate_ms_ops = {
 
 module_param_cb(power_gate_ms, &power_gate_ms_ops, &power_gate_ms, 0644);
 MODULE_PARM_DESC(power_gate_ms,
-		 "J713, J604: power the display coprocessor and its domains down after this many ms blanked, and before system sleep (0: never, the default; at most 600000; J604: testing)");
+		 "J713, J604: power the display coprocessor and its domains down after this many ms blanked, and before system sleep (0: never; default: the machine's, J604 5000, J713/J715 0; at most 600000; applies from the next blank)");
 
 /*
  * DCP CPU control and status, in the coprocessor's ASC block. The idle bit
@@ -2852,6 +2858,8 @@ static void iomfb_m4_machine_defaults(const struct dcp_m4_profile *pf)
 		WRITE_ONCE(panel_vrr_min_hz, pf->vrr_min_hz);
 	if (!READ_ONCE(panel_edr_given))
 		WRITE_ONCE(panel_edr, pf->edr);
+	if (!READ_ONCE(power_gate_ms_given))
+		WRITE_ONCE(power_gate_ms, pf->power_gate_ms);
 }
 
 int iomfb_m4_init(struct apple_dcp *owner)
